# Jexpress Brand Guide

This is the single source of truth for visual design in this project. Do not introduce colors, fonts, spacing patterns, or UI patterns not defined here.

---

## 1. Typography

### Font Families

| Role | Family | Variable | Tailwind Class |
|---|---|---|---|
| Headings & body copy | Lato | `--font-lato` | `font-sans` |
| UI labels, nav, meta, tags | Inter | `--font-inter` | `font-inter` |

Both fonts are loaded via `next/font/google` in `app/layout.tsx`. Never import fonts manually or use system fallbacks as primary faces.

### Font Weights (Lato)

| Weight | Usage |
|---|---|
| `font-black` (900) | Page `<h1>`, section `<h2>`, hero stats, number callouts |
| `font-bold` (700) | `<h3>`, CTA button labels, footer section headings |
| `font-semibold` (600) | Badge labels, tag labels (via Inter) |
| `font-medium` (500) | Nav links (via Inter), sub-labels |
| `font-normal` (400) | Body paragraphs, descriptions |
| `font-light` (300) | Captions, fine print when needed |

### Type Scale & Responsive Sizing

| Element | Mobile | Tablet (`sm`) | Desktop (`lg`) | Extra Large (`xl`) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `<h1>` hero | `text-4xl` | `text-5xl` | `text-6xl` | `text-7xl` |
| `<h1>` inner page | `text-4xl` | `text-5xl` | `text-6xl` | — |
| `<h2>` section | `text-3xl` | `text-4xl` | `text-5xl` | — |
| `<h3>` card/item | `text-xl` | `text-2xl` | — | — |
| Body / description | `text-base` | `text-lg` | — | — |
| Small body | `text-sm` | — | — | — |
| UI meta / labels | `text-xs` | — | — | — |

### Line Heights & Tracking

- Headings: `leading-tight`
- Body paragraphs: `leading-relaxed`
- Section eyebrow labels: `tracking-[0.2em]` or `tracking-widest`
- Nav links: `tracking-wide`
- Footer headings / key area labels: `tracking-widest`
- Use `text-balance` on all multi-line headings to prevent orphans.

### Eyebrow Labels (Section Labels)

All section eyebrow labels follow this exact pattern:

```tsx
<span className="inline-block text-[#f58c23] font-inter text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">
  Section Name
</span>
```

