## 2. Color Palette

All colors are defined as CSS variables in `app/globals.css`. Use the token names — never hardcode a hex value that isn't in this table.

### Brand Colors

| Token | Hex | Tailwind Utility | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--brand-orange` / `--primary` | `#f58c23` | `text-[#f58c23]` / `bg-[#f58c23]` | Primary CTA, highlights, icons, underlines, active states |
| `--brand-orange-dark` | `#d97b1a` | `bg-[#d97b1a]` | Hover state of orange buttons |
| `--brand-yellow` / `--accent` | `#fed16c` | `text-[#fed16c]` | Active nav links, decorative accents, star ratings |
| `--brand-dark` / `--secondary` | `#383838` | `bg-[#383838]` / `text-[#383838]` | Hero bg, header bg, dark sections, dark text on light |
| `--brand-light` | `#fff8f0` | `bg-[#fff8f0]` | Warm light section backgrounds |

### Semantic / Surface Colors

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--background` | `#ffffff` | Default page background |
| `--foreground` | `#383838` | Default body text |
| `--muted` | `#f9f4ef` | Alternating card row backgrounds |
| `--muted-foreground` | `#6b6b6b` | Secondary descriptive text |
| `--border` | `#e8e0d8` | Card borders, dividers, input borders |
| `--card` | `#ffffff` | Card surfaces on light backgrounds |

### Dark Section Background Variants

| Hex | Usage |
|---|---|
| `#383838` | Primary dark bg (hero, header, inner page heroes) |
| `#2a2a2a` | Darker surface (footer, dropdowns, floating cards) |
| `#1a1a1a` | Deepest gradient stop only |

### Opacity Conventions on Dark Backgrounds

| Class | Usage |
|---|---|
| `text-white` | Primary text on dark bg |
| `text-white/80` | Nav links (default) |
| `text-white/70` | Hero body text |
| `text-white/60` | Secondary descriptive text on dark |
| `text-white/50` | Footer body and contact text |
| `text-white/40` | Copyright / legal fine print |
| `text-white/30` | Subtle attribution text |
| `bg-white/10` | Ghost surface hover, icon circle bg |
| `bg-white/5` | Subtle row hover in dropdowns |
| `border-white/10` | Dividers on dark surfaces |
| `border-white/5` | Very subtle borders in menus |
| `border-white/30` | Ghost button border (default) |

### Gradient Patterns

- **Hero background**: `linear-gradient(135deg, #383838 0%, #2a2a2a 40%, #1a1a1a 100%)`
- **Hero overlay accents**: Radial orange glow top-right at 20% opacity; radial yellow glow bottom-left at 10% opacity
- **Inner page hero overlay**: `linear-gradient(to bottom, #38383880 0%, #383838 100%)`
- **Decorative hr**: `linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #f58c23, transparent)`
- **Card image overlay**: `linear-gradient(to bottom right, transparent 60%, #383838 100%)`

