## 3. Buttons

### Primary Button (CTA)

```tsx
className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#f58c23] hover:bg-[#d97b1a] text-white font-bold text-base px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 shadow-xl shadow-[#f58c23]/40"
```

- Shape: `rounded-full`
- Default padding: `px-8 py-4` (large sections), `px-6 py-2.5` (header/compact)
- Font: `font-bold`, `text-base` (large) or `text-sm` (compact)
- Hover: background → `#d97b1a`, scale up `hover:scale-105`
- Active: scale down `active:scale-95`
- Shadow: `shadow-xl shadow-[#f58c23]/40` on large, `shadow-lg shadow-[#f58c23]/30` on compact

### Ghost / Outline Button (Secondary)

```tsx
className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-2 border-white/30 hover:border-[#f58c23] text-white hover:text-[#f58c23] font-semibold text-base px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-200"
```

- Used on dark backgrounds only
- Hover: border and text both transition to `#f58c23`
- No background fill; no shadow

### Rules

- All buttons use `transition-all duration-200`
- All buttons include icons (`RiArrowRightLine` or similar) where directional intent exists
- Disabled state: `opacity-50 pointer-events-none`
- Never use square corners (`rounded-md`) on marketing CTA buttons — always `rounded-full`

