## 4. Links & Navigation

### Nav Links (Desktop)

```tsx
className="font-inter text-sm tracking-wide font-medium relative group transition-colors duration-200 text-white/80 hover:text-[#fed16c]"
// Active:
className="font-inter text-sm tracking-wide font-medium ... text-[#fed16c]"
```

- Active state: `text-[#fed16c]` + full-width `h-0.5 bg-[#f58c23]` underline
- Hover state: text → `#fed16c`, underline animates from `w-0` to `w-full`
- Underline animation: `transition-all duration-300`

### Dropdown Menu Links

```tsx
// Default:
className="text-white/70 hover:text-[#fed16c] hover:bg-white/5"
// Active:
className="text-[#fed16c] bg-white/5"
```

- Container: `bg-[#2a2a2a] border border-white/10 rounded-xl shadow-2xl`
- Padding: `px-5 py-3`
- Separator: `border-b border-white/5`

### Footer Links

```tsx
className="text-white/50 hover:text-[#f58c23] font-inter text-sm transition-colors duration-200"
```

### Inline Text Links (on light bg)

```tsx
className="text-[#f58c23] hover:text-[#d97b1a] transition-colors"
```

### External / Contact Links

Same pattern as footer links. Use `hover:text-[#f58c23]` for all contact details (phone, email).

