## 5. Cards

### Service / Content Card (Light Background)

```tsx
className="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#e8e0d8] bg-white"
// Alternating rows:
className="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#e8e0d8] bg-[#fdf8f4]"
```

- Border radius: `rounded-2xl`
- Border: `border border-[#e8e0d8]`
- No drop shadow by default

### Floating / Overlay Card (Dark Background)

```tsx
className="bg-[#383838]/90 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#f58c23]/30 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 shadow-xl"
```

### Image Frame Card

```tsx
className="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#f58c23]/30 shadow-2xl shadow-[#f58c23]/20"
```

### Icon Badge

```tsx
className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#f58c23]/10 flex items-center justify-center"
// Icon inside:
className="text-[#f58c23]"  // size={22} strokeWidth={1.75}
```

### Tag / Pill

```tsx
className="inline-block bg-[#f58c23]/10 text-[#c97818] font-inter font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-full"
```

### Eyebrow Badge (Dark BG)

```tsx
className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#f58c23]/15 border border-[#f58c23]/30 text-[#fed16c] text-xs font-inter font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-2 rounded-full w-fit"
```

