## 6. Section Layout

### Max Width & Padding

```tsx
className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"
```

Always `max-w-7xl`. Horizontal padding is always `px-6` (24px) at all breakpoints — never less.

### Section Vertical Spacing

| Context | Spacing |
|---|---|
| Standard section | `py-24` |
| Hero inner content | `pt-32 pb-20` |
| Inner page hero | `pt-40 pb-20` |
| Footer | `pt-16 pb-8` |

### Section Header Block

```tsx
<div className="text-center mb-16">
  <span className="inline-block text-[#f58c23] font-inter text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">
    Eyebrow Label
  </span>
  <h2 className="font-sans font-black text-[#383838] text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight text-balance">
    Section <span className="text-[#f58c23]">Highlight Word</span>
  </h2>
</div>
```

- The highlighted keyword within `<h2>` is always wrapped in `<span className="text-[#f58c23]">`.
- Use `text-balance` on all headings.

### Background Alternation

| Surface | Color |
|---|---|
| Light default | `bg-white` |
| Light warm alternate | `bg-[#f9f4ef]` or `bg-[#fff8f0]` |
| Dark primary | `bg-[#383838]` |
| Dark footer | `bg-[#2a2a2a]` |

Never use arbitrary grays that are not from the palette above.

